  "name": "Validated Only",
  "description": "A reader policy that exposes only assertions accepted under selected validation policies and authority channels. Validated-only does not mean maximum certainty, universal truth, or universal agreement. It means every visible assertion satisfies this policy's validation, authority, certainty, and scope filters.",

  "created_at": "2026-06-12T16:22:19Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-06-12T16:22:19Z",

